<div class="tldr"><p><strong>Short answer:</strong> for skiing, Outdoor Life's top heated ski sock is the <strong>Hotronic XLP 2P</strong> (slim fit, about 9 hours on high). Field & Stream's best overall is the <strong>Gerbing 7V wool sock</strong>. For less money, the <strong>Fieldsheer Premium 2.0 Merino</strong> (about $80, app control) and <strong>Savior Heat</strong> (under $80, big battery) are reviewer picks. Expect about 3 hours on high for most pairs.</p></div>

